# Upgrade plan: gap table, honest comparison, and validity review

Step 0 of [the upgrade plan](UPGRADE_PLAN.md). What exists is described in [STATUS.md](STATUS.md).
Competitor descriptions were checked against their own pages on 2026-09-30 and are recorded in
[RELATED_WORK.md §8](RELATED_WORK.md#8-consumer-gpu-tiered-kv-forks-of-llamacpp). Their published
numbers are on different hardware, so none of them is reproduced here as if it were a measurement.

